 arranging the lighting. This landmark case (Burrow-Giles Lithographic Co. v. Sarony) is the reason photographs are considered protected art today. Id X.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-10T18:21:25Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "wilde", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-10T18:21:27Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "oscar", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-10T18:21:40Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Wow, TIL", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-10T18:21:40Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Oscar Wilde is correct", "role": "confirmation", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-10T18:21:44Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Shyam 5 KP 95 Sal 15 Srijan 15", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-10T18:22:16Z", "username": "Tapish", "text": "Everyone on Suraj Randiv mode now", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-10T18:22:44Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Abhishek question scrap kardega", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-10T18:22:45Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Noball", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-10T18:22:46Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "the Statute of Anne - the world's first true copyright statute came into effect on this day in 1710", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]